/**
 * patch: log advisor LLM token usage to ~/.pi/token-logs/usage.jsonl
 *
 * The pi-token-tracker extension only hooks into the main session's
 * message pipeline (pi.on("message_end", ...)). The advisor tool uses
 * completeSimple() directly, bypassing that pipeline entirely, so its
 * token usage is never recorded.
 *
 * This patch adds a logAdvisorUsage() call right after completeSimple()
 * returns, writing a record to the same usage.jsonl file in the exact
 * same format as the token tracker. This ensures advisor calls appear
 * in the token-stats dashboard.
 *
 * === Changes ===
 *
 * 1. Add imports for filesystem operations
 * 2. Add logAdvisorUsage() helper
 * 3. Insert logging call after completeSimple() before early returns
 *
 * === Apply ===
 *   patch -u node_modules/@juicesharp/rpiv-advisor/advisor/execute.ts \
 *            < patches/rpiv-advisor/execute.ts.patch
 *
 * === Revert ===
 *   cp patches/rpiv-advisor/execute.ts.orig \
 *      node_modules/@juicesharp/rpiv-advisor/advisor/execute.ts
 *
 * === Re-apply after npm update ===
 *   ./patches/rpiv-advisor/apply-patch.sh
 */
--- a/advisor/execute.ts	2026-06-18 10:30:00
+++ b/advisor/execute.ts	2026-06-18 10:30:00
